1250
00:54:19.030 --> 00:54:20.310
he just handed to me with his hands.

1251
00:54:20.450 --> 00:54:23.350
And so I improvised that line and it stayed in and it makes

1252
00:54:23.350 --> 00:54:23.810
me laugh.

1253
00:54:23.950 --> 00:54:25.670
Of course, she goes ahead and eats it.

1254
00:54:25.810 --> 00:54:27.330
So I guess she's not too concerned.

1255
00:54:27.810 --> 00:54:28.950
But it's clearly

1256
00:54:28.950 --> 00:54:31.230
she's just like not having a good time.

1257
00:54:31.410 --> 00:54:34.810
And she's a little like grossed out because she's seeing a lot

1258
00:54:34.810 --> 00:54:35.310
of feet.

1259
00:54:35.710 --> 00:54:39.050
And now a guy just handed her bread with his hands, a stranger.

1260
00:54:39.310 --> 00:54:40.290
Well, in the script,

1261
00:54:40.370 --> 00:54:43.910
it says that you take a bite and say, oh, garlic.

1262
00:54:45.070 --> 00:54:47.370
We had some fan questions about the foods.

1263
00:54:47.370 --> 00:54:52.490
Stacey and Rutt V both wrote in to say, was any of that delicious looking buffet food real?

1264
00:54:52.930 --> 00:54:56.250
Did you get to sample some of the cuisine while filming this episode?

1265
00:54:56.470 --> 00:54:58.290
Guys, it was all real food.

1266
00:54:59.370 --> 00:55:00.450
It was all real.

1267
00:55:00.610 --> 00:55:01.490
It was all delicious.

1268
00:55:01.790 --> 00:55:07.510
Kent told me we hired a specialty food stylist to create the food, that it was authentically

1269
00:55:07.510 --> 00:55:11.630
prepared, and we had it all three days of filming and we got to eat it.

1270
00:55:11.730 --> 00:55:13.710
And I remember that it was delicious.

1271
00:55:14.110 --> 00:55:14.790
It was delicious.

1272
00:55:14.790 --> 00:55:17.650
I only got to eat the naan, but it was very good naan.

1273
00:55:18.290 --> 00:55:20.250
Oh, I ate between takes.

1274
00:55:20.630 --> 00:55:21.830
I just ate it.

1275
00:55:22.150 --> 00:55:24.490
You don't even see Pam eating it on screen.

1276
00:55:24.490 --> 00:55:25.910
I was like, I will eat this.

1277
00:55:26.150 --> 00:55:31.830
Well, now we come to one of the moments in this episode that is one of my favorites, Angela.

1278
00:55:32.210 --> 00:55:35.710
This is when Ryan meets Kelly's giggly sisters.

1279
00:55:36.150 --> 00:55:36.370
Yeah.

1280
00:55:37.210 --> 00:55:39.030
It's so, so cute.

1281
00:55:39.190 --> 00:55:44.230
We got some fan questions from Lindsay, Bridget, and Dan, who all want to know,

1282
00:55:44.230 --> 00:55:48.510
do you know what Kelly's sister is saying when they're talking to Ryan?

1283
00:55:48.770 --> 00:55:49.790
They're saying something

1284
00:55:49.790 --> 00:55:50.770
about Zach Braff.

1285
00:55:51.030 --> 00:55:51.230
Okay.

1286
00:55:51.250 --> 00:55:53.290
Here's what the three little girls say.

1287
00:55:53.490 --> 00:55:55.710
They say, Kelly likes Zach

1288
00:55:55.710 --> 00:55:56.430
Braff.

1289
00:55:57.130 --> 00:55:59.250
That's what they're saying in Hindi.

1290
00:55:59.390 --> 00:56:00.790
And they're sort of like teasing him.

1291
00:56:00.930 --> 00:56:01.930
They were so

1292
00:56:01.930 --> 00:56:02.570
cute.

1293
00:56:02.730 --> 00:56:07.210
And they were played by Tanvir Atwal, Ananya Keper, and Jaysha Patel.

1294
00:56:07.390 --> 00:56:09.350
Well, the little girl who

1295
00:56:09.350 --> 00:56:12.490
plays Kelly's sister that says the Zach Braff line.

1296
00:56:12.650 --> 00:56:13.650
That's Jaysha.

1297
00:56:14.010 --> 00:56:16.130
I found her on Instagram and I

1298
00:56:16.130 --> 00:56:19.410
reached out to her to ask her about what it was like to be on the show.

1299
00:56:19.570 --> 00:56:20.570
And she wrote back.

1300
00:56:20.570 --> 00:56:20.950
I

1301
00:56:20.950 --> 00:56:21.830
can't wait to share.

1302
00:56:22.070 --> 00:56:24.510
She must be like a grown lady now.

1303
00:56:24.750 --> 00:56:26.490
She is a grown woman now.

1304
00:56:26.650 --> 00:56:27.450
She told me she was

1305
00:56:27.450 --> 00:56:29.910
13 years old when she shot this episode.

1306
00:56:30.190 --> 00:56:33.070
She said she had not really heard about the show.

1307
00:56:33.070 --> 00:56:36.290
She was still watching Disney Channel, she said.

1308
00:56:36.450 --> 00:56:41.930
But she said her dad took her to the audition, and she remembers walking into the casting

1309
00:56:41.930 --> 00:56:47.790
office and just seeing tons of other kids who were all there for the same role.

1310
00:56:47.930 --> 00:56:51.650
And she said the audition was just her saying that one line in Hindi.

1311
00:56:51.970 --> 00:56:54.110
And she said she didn't speak any Hindi.

1312
00:56:54.290 --> 00:56:59.110
So her dad told her how to say it about five seconds before she went into the audition

1313
00:56:59.110 --> 00:57:01.010
room, and then she got the part.

1314
00:57:01.550 --> 00:57:04.010
So she said she was so excited.

1315
00:57:04.010 --> 00:57:08.070
And I asked her what it was like to be on set, if she had any memories.

1316
00:57:08.070 --> 00:57:10.310
And she sent back the sweetest message.

1317
00:57:10.310 --> 00:57:11.990
So we're going to play it for you now.

1318
00:57:12.610 --> 00:57:17.530
I remember Rainn Wilson walking up to me and shoving a lightsaber in my hand and yelling,

1319
00:57:17.670 --> 00:57:18.590
Lightsaber war.

1320
00:57:18.830 --> 00:57:23.690
I also remember getting to know Mindy Kaling and BJ Novak, who were so sweet to me.

1321
00:57:24.230 --> 00:57:28.130
Meeting Mindy Kaling really meant a lot to me growing up because I didn't really see

1322
00:57:28.130 --> 00:57:31.390
many Indian actresses in the entertainment industry at that time.

1323
00:57:31.530 --> 00:57:32.630
And I love what Mindy

1324
00:57:32.630 --> 00:57:33.930
has done with her platform.

1325
00:57:33.930 --> 00:57:37.070
And she is still a huge inspiration for me till this day.

1326
00:57:37.210 --> 00:57:37.890
I also

1327
00:57:37.890 --> 00:57:41.690
remember all of the delicious Indian food on set and getting to dance all day.

1328
00:57:41.870 --> 00:57:42.610
And I remember being

1329
00:57:42.610 --> 00:57:45.790
so happy that I had the chance to wear my Indian clothes.

1330
00:57:46.210 --> 00:57:47.450
Isn't that so sweet?

1331
00:57:47.610 --> 00:57:48.570
That is wonderful.

1332
00:57:49.070 --> 00:57:53.290
That as I listened to it, I was just smiling so big because that is everything about that

1333
00:57:53.290 --> 00:57:54.030
message is lovely.

1334
00:57:54.230 --> 00:57:55.310
I love all of her memories.

1335
00:57:55.510 --> 00:57:58.370
She's absolutely right about Mindy and what Mindy

1336
00:57:58.370 --> 00:57:58.950
has done.

1337
00:57:59.110 --> 00:58:01.950
And she's such an inspiration to so many people.

1338
00:58:02.990 --> 00:58:03.530
Yes.

1339
00:58:03.910 --> 00:58:04.270
Yeah.

1340
00:58:04.710 --> 00:58:06.470
She told me after the

1341
00:58:06.470 --> 00:58:11.550
episode aired, she had classmates and family members reaching out that they had recorded it

1342
00:58:11.550 --> 00:58:14.170
and taking pictures of her name in the credits.

1343
00:58:15.130 --> 00:58:17.470
So that was when she was 13.

1344
00:58:17.470 --> 00:58:18.130
She really wanted

1345
00:58:18.130 --> 00:58:18.770
to be an actress.

1346
00:58:18.790 --> 00:58:23.470
She said when she was 15, she decided she wanted to go into journalism.

1347
00:58:23.770 --> 00:58:24.230
And now

1348
00:58:24.230 --> 00:58:28.690
Jaysha is the morning news reporter at NBC 15 in Mobile, Alabama.

1349
00:58:29.230 --> 00:58:31.030
She told me she has to go to bed

1350
00:58:31.030 --> 00:58:35.710
at four o'clock in the afternoon because she has to be in the studio at 3 30 in the morning.

1351
00:58:36.210 --> 00:58:41.890
I have always heard that about these morning anchors on the East Coast that they have to get

1352
00:58:41.890 --> 00:58:43.290
up so early.

1353
00:58:43.630 --> 00:58:45.270
That's amazing though, Jaysha.

1354
00:58:45.590 --> 00:58:46.690
That is so cool.

1355
00:58:47.070 --> 00:58:48.090
Isn't that so cool?

1356
00:58:48.210 --> 00:58:48.970
She said all her

1357
00:58:48.970 --> 00:58:54.670
co-workers know about her appearance on The Office and that fans will mention to her because she's

1358
00:58:54.670 --> 00:58:55.010
Indian.

1359
00:58:55.550 --> 00:58:59.750
They'll mention the Diwali episode and then she always like blows their mind when she

1360
00:58:59.750 --> 00:59:01.230
says, oh no, I was in it.

1361
00:59:01.570 --> 00:59:03.190
So I thought that was so sweet.

1362
00:59:03.410 --> 00:59:04.150
I was in it.

1363
00:59:04.210 --> 00:59:05.590
I say a line that offends

1364
00:59:05.590 --> 00:59:06.410
Ryan the temp.

1365
00:59:07.010 --> 00:59:08.390
Yes, exactly.

1366
00:59:08.690 --> 00:59:11.910
Except he doesn't quite know he's being the butt of a joke.

1367
00:59:12.150 --> 00:59:12.330
Right.

1368
00:59:12.470 --> 00:59:17.950
But she said being on The Office was one of her most memorable moments of her childhood.

1369
00:59:18.210 --> 00:59:18.610
I also

1370
00:59:18.610 --> 00:59:23.070
love that, you know, I'm sure Rain improvised going up to her with that lightsaber.

1371
00:59:23.350 --> 00:59:23.550
There's

1372
00:59:23.550 --> 00:59:27.410
a bunch of deleted scenes where he's fighting with kids with lightsabers.

1373
00:59:28.610 --> 00:59:29.990
And it didn't make it in,

1374
00:59:29.990 --> 00:59:34.790
But he, Rain looked very much in his element, like that's how he bonds with children.

1375
00:59:35.490 --> 00:59:35.810
Yes.

1376
00:59:36.150 --> 00:59:39.710
Angela, should we check in on those folks at Stanford, see how they're doing?

1377
00:59:39.890 --> 00:59:41.990
You mean the folks drinking Jägermeister?

1378
00:59:42.270 --> 00:59:42.530
Yeah.

1379
00:59:42.750 --> 00:59:43.470
How are they?

1380
00:59:43.770 --> 00:59:45.970
And Angela, did you see what they ordered for dinner?

1381
00:59:46.110 --> 00:59:47.910
Oh, Jenna, you and I know firsthand.

1382
00:59:48.770 --> 00:59:53.130
You do not drink a lot of alcohol and only eat sushi.

1383
00:59:53.510 --> 00:59:55.310
Now, Angela, why do we know that firsthand?

1384
00:59:55.310 --> 00:59:59.210
We know that because at the Golden Globes, was it the Golden Globes, Jenna?

1385
01:00:00.210 --> 01:00:04.010
Oh, lady, I was thinking of my bachelorette party that you planned for me.

1386
01:00:04.030 --> 01:00:06.430
Oh, well, there was the Golden Globes, but the bachelorette...

1387
01:00:06.430 --> 01:00:09.190
Wait, have we repeated this mistake multiple times?

1388
01:00:09.190 --> 01:00:11.750
Yes, except the second time I did better.

1389
01:00:11.930 --> 01:00:14.310
The first time, it did not work out well for me.

1390
01:00:14.410 --> 01:00:20.990
The second time, if memory serves, sorry to say this on here, but it hit your sister pretty hard.

1391
01:00:21.990 --> 01:00:22.470
Yeah.

1392
01:00:23.030 --> 01:00:27.490
Guys, Angela planned a bachelorette party for me when I was getting married to Lee,

1393
01:00:27.490 --> 01:00:30.630
and she took us all out for a sushi dinner.

1394
01:00:30.870 --> 01:00:35.530
It was a fancy schmancy sushi place in Beverly Hills

1395
01:00:35.530 --> 01:00:38.110
that I'd never eaten at, I'd only dreamed of.

1396
01:00:38.230 --> 01:00:41.330
And I was like, can we go there for my bachelorette?

1397
01:00:41.410 --> 01:00:43.270
They were thrilled to have us.

1398
01:00:43.390 --> 01:00:44.310
It was so cute.

1399
01:00:44.490 --> 01:00:46.350
All of the ladies from the office were there.

1400
01:00:46.530 --> 01:00:48.270
All of my other friends were there.

1401
01:00:48.410 --> 01:00:53.110
And afterwards, you took us to a dance club.

1402
01:00:53.450 --> 01:00:54.170
Hold up, hold up, lady.

1403
01:00:54.430 --> 01:00:55.830
We're going to get this right.

1404
01:00:55.830 --> 01:00:58.950
First of all, the sushi place was your idea.

1405
01:00:59.170 --> 01:01:03.210
And then after the sushi place, you guys, I got cupcakes with like her face on it.

1406
01:01:03.310 --> 01:01:03.950
It was so cute.

1407
01:01:04.150 --> 01:01:07.330
We had lots of free drinks sent over.

1408
01:01:07.430 --> 01:01:10.830
The restaurant was very kind and lots of great sushi.

1409
01:01:11.530 --> 01:01:16.890
And then after the dinner, I was like, well, thank you guys.

1410
01:01:17.070 --> 01:01:18.290
And Jenna was like, what's next?

1411
01:01:18.570 --> 01:01:20.290
And I was like, uh, what?

1412
01:01:21.590 --> 01:01:22.330
Wait, what?

1413
01:01:22.450 --> 01:01:22.810
Do you not?

1414
01:01:23.010 --> 01:01:23.810
Is this true?

1415
01:01:24.090 --> 01:01:25.270
I do not remember this.

1416
01:01:25.270 --> 01:01:25.970
No.

1417
01:01:26.310 --> 01:01:28.510
Lady, all I had planned was the dinner.

1418
01:01:28.730 --> 01:01:30.730
I didn't plan anything after.

1419
01:01:30.910 --> 01:01:33.050
Is this the first time you're ever hearing of this?

1420
01:01:33.970 --> 01:01:34.410
Yes.

1421
01:01:36.050 --> 01:01:40.370
This is putting the dance club into perspective now.

1422
01:01:40.510 --> 01:01:43.030
Because I thought at the time it was an odd choice.

1423
01:01:43.690 --> 01:01:46.530
Because we've never in a million years gone clubbing.

1424
01:01:46.770 --> 01:01:49.670
And now we were suddenly clubbing for my bachelorette.

1425
01:01:49.750 --> 01:01:51.270
But I was like, this is great.

1426
01:01:51.430 --> 01:01:52.290
What a fun idea.

1427
01:01:52.390 --> 01:01:53.990
Yeah, I should say, you guys, we had a car.

1428
01:01:53.990 --> 01:01:57.250
I got one of the big limos, you know, that we could all pile in.

1429
01:01:57.350 --> 01:02:01.630
And I called a friend of mine who is like always kind of like that.

1430
01:02:01.810 --> 01:02:03.810
You know, you have that one friend that's like, I got a hookup.

1431
01:02:03.930 --> 01:02:04.530
I got a hookup.

1432
01:02:05.470 --> 01:02:06.550
Yeah, I'm in the know.

1433
01:02:06.830 --> 01:02:12.270
I called my friend Tess and I was like, Tess, I Jenna wants to go dancing.

1434
01:02:12.490 --> 01:02:14.190
I were in Beverly Hills.

1435
01:02:14.290 --> 01:02:14.690
What do I do?

1436
01:02:14.770 --> 01:02:15.210
What do I do?

1437
01:02:15.310 --> 01:02:16.350
And she was like, I'm on it.

1438
01:02:16.570 --> 01:02:17.930
Give me like five, 10 minutes.

1439
01:02:18.110 --> 01:02:21.090
I said, OK, so we kind of hung out a little bit.

1440
01:02:21.210 --> 01:02:23.550
And I was like, I'm sorting out some stuff, guys.

1441
01:02:23.550 --> 01:02:26.530
I do remember hanging out on the sidewalk outside.

1442
01:02:26.790 --> 01:02:30.930
Yes, it's because I didn't have a plan because the restaurant I had planned for was fancy

1443
01:02:30.930 --> 01:02:34.970
sushi and our evening would have been over at like 10 o'clock.

1444
01:02:35.350 --> 01:02:35.570
Yeah.

1445
01:02:35.990 --> 01:02:41.370
Anyway, I get a call from Tess and she goes, all right, Angela, it's pretty last minute.

1446
01:02:41.630 --> 01:02:44.410
It's like, you know, a Thursday night in Beverly Hills.

1447
01:02:44.590 --> 01:02:46.310
So I did get you in this one club.

1448
01:02:46.510 --> 01:02:47.290
I know this guy.

1449
01:02:47.450 --> 01:02:50.570
He's got a booth for you and they're going to give you drink service.

1450
01:02:50.770 --> 01:02:52.910
It's kind of a random club, but it'll be fun.

1451
01:02:52.910 --> 01:02:54.010
you guys can dance.

1452
01:02:54.510 --> 01:02:58.630
Angela, it's the only time I've ever experienced bottle service.

1453
01:02:59.230 --> 01:03:05.870
Bottle service is where you like, they bring you just bottles of alcohol and then mixers and like

1454
01:03:05.870 --> 01:03:09.630
little cut limes to your table and you make your drinks.

1455
01:03:09.630 --> 01:03:11.630
Also, when they walk it over, everyone

1456
01:03:11.630 --> 01:03:15.970
starts doing, at least for us, I think this was the norm because I would see different people get

1457
01:03:15.970 --> 01:03:21.390
bottle service and it was like, and they shut off like confetti in the air.

1458
01:03:21.490 --> 01:03:22.470
It was so weird.

1459
01:03:22.470 --> 01:03:23.790
It was so bizarre.

1460
01:03:24.070 --> 01:03:26.350
They had it was crazy dancing.

1461
01:03:26.530 --> 01:03:31.710
I remember we got in trouble because we were dancing on top of the couches and we got reprimanded for that.

1462
01:03:32.310 --> 01:03:44.390
But guys, on our stomachs of sushi mixed with bottle service, long story short, at the end of the night as the limo is dropping everyone off,

1463
01:03:44.590 --> 01:03:47.170
my sister puked in Ellie Kemper's bushes.

1464
01:03:49.190 --> 01:03:51.030
I puked when I got home.

1465
01:03:51.030 --> 01:03:52.430
It was in my hair.

1466
01:03:52.630 --> 01:03:53.750
I slept in it.

1467
01:03:54.250 --> 01:03:55.950
It was an epic night.

1468
01:03:56.310 --> 01:03:57.090
But that's

1469
01:03:57.090 --> 01:04:00.170
what you get when you mix sushi and a lot of booze.

1470
01:04:00.290 --> 01:04:02.090
And that is what is in store for these

1471
01:04:02.090 --> 01:04:02.909
guys in Stanford.

1472
01:04:02.909 --> 01:04:03.150
Yeah.

1473
01:04:03.150 --> 01:04:06.570
As Jenna and I rewatched this episode, I texted her and I was like, oh,

1474
01:04:06.750 --> 01:04:08.470
lady, alcohol and sushi.

1475
01:04:09.370 --> 01:04:10.550
It's so true.

1476
01:04:10.870 --> 01:04:12.530
It is so true.

1477
01:04:13.350 --> 01:04:14.990
Should we go back to Diwali?

1478
01:04:15.310 --> 01:04:15.550
Because

1479
01:04:15.550 --> 01:04:19.250
Roy has arrived and he is watching Pam dance and have fun.

1480
01:04:19.730 --> 01:04:22.610
And I have a full Mindy catch for you

1481
01:04:22.610 --> 01:04:23.110
right here.

1482
01:04:23.290 --> 01:04:25.710
And we've got a sting for it and everything.

1483
01:04:29.000 --> 01:04:30.120
There you go.

1484
01:04:30.300 --> 01:04:31.260
It's a full Mindy

1485
01:04:31.260 --> 01:04:31.780
catch.

1486
01:04:32.260 --> 01:04:39.540
Mira During wrote in to say, at the Diwali party when Roy walks in, Beyonce's crazy in love

1487
01:04:39.540 --> 01:04:41.060
is playing in the background.

1488
01:04:41.280 --> 01:04:44.300
And Angela, this was a note in the script.

1489
01:04:44.560 --> 01:04:46.560
Mindy wrote in what song

1490
01:04:46.560 --> 01:04:50.820
would be playing when Roy walks in and that it would be a Beyonce song.

1491
01:04:50.880 --> 01:04:52.460
So I think this is a

1492
01:04:52.460 --> 01:04:54.220
full, full Mindy.

1493
01:04:54.420 --> 01:04:55.320
I love it.

1494
01:04:55.380 --> 01:04:57.400
